course: dictionary
lesson: 3237
title: Wanting what others have
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: The word envious means wanting something that someone else has, and feeling unhappy that you do not have it too. Jealous is a close word with a similar meaning. Context helps you spot it: look for a person who has something good and another who wishes they had it.
explain: In an old story, a farm owner pays every worker the same amount. The owner asks, «Are you envious because I am generous?» The clue is generous: the owner gave everyone the same, and some workers felt unhappy about what others got. So envious means feeling unhappy at someone else's good luck.
explain: Feeling envious is normal, like feeling envious of a friend's new bike. What matters is what you do next. In stories, envious people often cause trouble. Cinderella's stepsisters were envious of her, and Joseph's brothers were envious of him.
fact: Envious means wanting what someone else has and feeling unhappy about it.
fact: Envious is an adjective. Its forms are envious, more envious and most envious.
fact: «Green with envy» is a phrase that means very envious.
fact: Envy is one of the «seven deadly sins» in Christian teaching.
fact: Some people argue about what the workers' story teaches, so you can think about it for yourself.
exercise: «Are you envious because I am generous?» What does envious mean here? | Tired after a long walk | Very happy for someone else | *Unhappy that someone else has something good | Hungry for food
exercise: Priya was green with envy when her friend got a new bike. What does green with envy mean? | Feeling sick | Happy to share | *Very envious | Painting something green
exercise: Cinderella's stepsisters were envious of her. What did they feel? | Hunger for food | Surprise at her dress | Kindness towards her | *Wanting what she had and feeling unhappy
test: Which word is a close synonym for envious? | *Jealous | Curious | Tired | Generous
test: Is feeling envious always wrong? | No, envy is always a good thing | *Feeling it is normal, but acting on it badly is not | Only grown-ups ever feel envy | Yes, every feeling of envy is wrong
exam: In the story, why does the owner ask, «Are you envious because I am generous?» | Because he is angry about the work | Because he wants to sell the vineyard | Because it is raining in the vineyard | *Because some workers felt unhappy about what others received
